54: Constructor `Symfony\Component\HttpClient\CachingHttpClient::__construct()` is deprecated: pass a `Symfony\Contracts\Cache\TagAwareCacheInterface` such as a `TagAwareAdapter`, which stores the responses by RFC 9111 without `HttpCache`, since symfony/http-client 7.4.
56: Constructor `Symfony\Component\HttpClient\CachingHttpClient::__construct()` is deprecated: pass a positive number of seconds such as `86400`, the default, which caps the lifetime of every cached response, since symfony/http-client 8.1.
